  "name": "Size Distribution of Phytoplankton in the Western Pacific Ocean and Adjacent Waters in Summer",
  "description": "Size distribution of phytoplankton in terms of cell number and carbon content were examined in summer. Carbon content was determined by conversion from cell volume that was estimated by image analysis of microscopic images of cells.\n\nDeposited content: descriptive metadata only; underlying research data are not included.\n\nPurpose: Comparison of phytoplankton cell size structure among different areas of the Pacific and adjacent waters.",
  "url": "https://zenodo.org/records/23519247",
